{"seq":3,"slug":"reference-atlas-label-transfer","title":"参考图谱构建与标签转移工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/trajectory-integration-atlas/reference-atlas-label-transfer","wordCount":2955,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"参考图谱构建与标签转移工程实践\">参考图谱构建与标签转移工程实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-把-每次重新注释-变成-一次构建-多次投影\">核心概念：把「每次重新注释」变成「一次构建、多次投影」</h2><p>单细胞注释的成本结构极不对称：第一次注释一个组织需要数周的人工审阅、marker 基因对照和文献核对；而第二个、第十个、第一百个同组织样本的注释，本质上是同一个问题的重复求解。参考图谱（reference atlas）工程就是把这份重复成本一次性固化——构建一个有权威细胞类型标签、跨供体跨批次稳健的<strong>参考嵌入空间</strong>，之后新样本只需投影（project）进去、读取最近邻的标签，而无需从零聚类。</p>\n<p>这与上一节的<a href=\"multi-sample-integration-methods\">多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制</a>是同一套数学、不同的使用姿态。整合是「所有样本一起算 latent」的对称操作；参考映射是「参考侧算一次、查询侧单向投影」的非对称操作。非对称带来两个工程好处：参考嵌入冻结后所有下游分析（marker 集、细胞类型比例基线、空间共定位统计）都有了<strong>统一的坐标系</strong>，跨研究可比；新样本标注可以在分钟级完成，使得图谱随测序队列增量更新成为可能。</p>\n<p>标签转移（label transfer）是投影的产物：把查询细胞的表达向量映射到参考嵌入，取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个最近邻参考细胞的标签做多数投票或加权投票。设查询细胞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 到参考邻居 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{qr}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，常用的距离加权投票得分为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_q(t) = \\sum_{r \\in N_k(q)} \\frac{1}{d_{qr} + \\epsilon}\\,\\mathbb{1}[\\,y_r = t\\,]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.8374em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是参考细胞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的标签，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 防止除零。取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arg\\max_t s_q(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 得到预测标签，投票的集中程度（top-1 得分占比）则是一个天然的<strong>置信度</strong>信号，用于把「图谱没见过的细胞类型」筛出来交给人工。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[参考数据集&lt;br/&gt;带权威标签 multicohort] --&gt; B[参考整合&lt;br/&gt;Harmony / scVI / scANVI]&#10;    B --&gt; C[冻结参考嵌入&lt;br/&gt;+ kNN 索引]&#10;    C --&gt; D[查询样本&lt;br/&gt;原始计数]&#10;    D --&gt; E[查询侧预处理&lt;br/&gt;与参考对齐的基因空间]&#10;    E --&gt; F[投影&lt;br/&gt;scArches / Symphony / scanorama]&#10;    F --&gt; G[kNN 标签投票&lt;br/&gt;+ 置信度]&#10;    G --&gt; H{置信度阈值}&#10;    H --&gt;|高| I[采纳转移标签]&#10;    H --&gt;|低| J[标记为未知&lt;br/&gt;交人工审阅]&#10;    I --&gt; K[更新细胞类型比例基线]&#10;    J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n    A[参考数据集&lt;br/&gt;带权威标签 multicohort] --&gt; B[参考整合&lt;br/&gt;Harmony / scVI / scANVI]\n    B --&gt; C[冻结参考嵌入&lt;br/&gt;+ kNN 索引]\n    C --&gt; D[查询样本&lt;br/&gt;原始计数]\n    D --&gt; E[查询侧预处理&lt;br/&gt;与参考对齐的基因空间]\n    E --&gt; F[投影&lt;br/&gt;scArches / Symphony / scanorama]\n    F --&gt; G[kNN 标签投票&lt;br/&gt;+ 置信度]\n    G --&gt; H{置信度阈值}\n    H --&gt;|高| I[采纳转移标签]\n    H --&gt;|低| J[标记为未知&lt;br/&gt;交人工审阅]\n    I --&gt; K[更新细胞类型比例基线]\n    J --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图谱路线</th>\n<th>代表实现</th>\n<th>参考嵌入形态</th>\n<th>查询侧是否需重训</th>\n<th>典型适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性投影</td>\n<td>Symphony、Seurat <code>MapQuery</code></td>\n<td>PCA 空间 + 簇中心</td>\n<td>否，闭式解</td>\n<td>同组织、查询与参考平台接近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度生成投影</td>\n<td>scArches（scVI/scANVI 后端）</td>\n<td>VAE latent</td>\n<td>微调少量 adapter 权重</td>\n<td>跨平台、跨物种、查询样本量大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落盘精细标签</td>\n<td>Azimuth（Seurat 参考工作流）</td>\n<td>分层的 UMAP + 监督标签</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>人/鼠 PBMC、脑等成熟组织</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑回归分类器</td>\n<td>CellTypist</td>\n<td>无需共享嵌入</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>免疫细胞亚型、快速批注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无监督对齐</td>\n<td>Scanorama、Ingest</td>\n<td>互近邻校正</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无预训练参考的临时映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"参考图谱的三层质量控制\">参考图谱的三层质量控制</h2><p>一个参考图谱能不能被信任，取决于它的标签质量而非细胞数量。工程上把参考质量拆成三层可验证的检查，缺一层都会让下游转移标签系统性偏移。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层是标签层级一致性。</strong> 参考细胞类型必须挂在一棵显式的层级树上（如 Cell Ontology 的 <code>CL:</code> 标识符体系），而不是一堆平铺的字符串。平铺标签会让转移结果在「T cell」和「CD4+ T cell」之间反复横跳——同一个查询细胞在不同参考子集下得到粒度不同的标签。工程做法是让参考标签同时携带 coarse 与 fine 两级，转移时先做 coarse 投票，只有在 coarse 置信度高时才下钻 fine。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层是参考自身的批次稳健性。</strong> 如果参考图谱内部某细胞类型只在单一供体中出现，那么任何查询细胞都会被吸向这个供体特异的表达模式。检验方法是留一供体交叉验证（leave-one-donor-out）：轮流扣掉一个供体重建参考，看剩余参考能否正确标注被扣供体的细胞。类型级召回率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与精度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的调和平均给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1 = 2\\cdot\\frac{P_t \\cdot R_t}{P_t + R_t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程阈值通常要求稀有类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1 \\ge 0.7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span></span></span></span></span>，主要类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span>；达不到的类型应合并到父节点，而不是硬留在参考里污染投影。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层是投影后的分布漂移监测。</strong> 查询样本投影后，其嵌入应与参考整体重叠；若查询细胞大量落在参考分布尾部，说明该样本含有图谱未覆盖的生物学状态。可用查询与参考在嵌入空间的 MMD（最大均值差异）或简单的分位数重叠度来量化，漂移超阈值时触发「图谱缺口」告警，而不是静默输出低质量标签。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查层</th>\n<th>观测对象</th>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n<th>工程动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标签层级</td>\n<td>Cell Ontology 映射</td>\n<td>粒度抖动</td>\n<td>coarse→fine 两级投票</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>参考稳健性</td>\n<td>留一供体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>供体特异吸引</td>\n<td>合并稀有类型到父节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投影漂移</td>\n<td>查询 vs 参考 MMD</td>\n<td>图谱缺口</td>\n<td>告警 + 人工审阅未知簇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"scarches-与-symphony-的工程取舍\">scArches 与 Symphony 的工程取舍</h2><p>两条路线在真实项目里最常被并列评估，理解它们的成本曲线比记住 API 更重要。</p>\n<p><strong>scArches</strong>（Lotfollahi 等，<em>Nature Biotechnology</em> 2022，doi:10.1038/s41587-021-01001-7）建立在 scVI 的变分自编码器之上。它的核心技巧是「架构 surgery」：参考训练完后，为每个查询数据集注入一组新的<strong>低秩 adapter 权重</strong>，冻结参考网络主体，只微调 adapter。这样查询样本能以很小的计算代价对齐到参考 latent，同时保留了查询特异的批次因子。代价是必须有原始计数、需要 GPU、且每次投影都涉及一次轻量训练，结果依赖随机种子，必须固定 <code>seed</code> 才能复现。</p>\n<p><strong>Symphony</strong>（Kang 等，<em>Nature Communications</em> 2021，doi:10.1038/s41467-021-25960-2）走闭式解路线：参考侧预先算好 Harmony 的 PCA 嵌入和软聚类中心，查询细胞先做同样的基因空间对齐，再通过一个约束优化把查询细胞映射到参考的簇中心附近，全程无需迭代训练、无需 GPU。代价是它假设查询与参考的批次结构可用同一套 Harmony 因子描述，跨平台（如 10x 3&#39; 到 5&#39;、或 Smart-seq2 到 10x）时性能下降明显。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>scArches</th>\n<th>Symphony</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否需要原始计数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（PCA 即可）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬件</td>\n<td>GPU 优先</td>\n<td>CPU 可跑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次投影成本</td>\n<td>分钟级微调</td>\n<td>秒级闭式映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复现性</td>\n<td>需固定 seed</td>\n<td>确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨平台稳健性</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨物种</td>\n<td>支持（同源基因对齐后）</td>\n<td>较弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验判据：<strong>查询与参考来自同平台、同组织、批次中等，选 Symphony</strong>；<strong>查询是跨平台、跨物种、或要投影成百上千个样本，选 scArches</strong>。两者都不是「参考侧一次构建就永久有效」——图谱应设定版本化重训周期（例如每吸收一个数量级的新样本重训一次），把参考嵌入本身当作有生命周期的制品对待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"未知细胞类型与开放集问题\">未知细胞类型与开放集问题</h2><p>标签转移最危险的不是「标错」，而是<strong>把图谱没见过的细胞自信地标成一个已存在的类型</strong>。这是一个开放集（open-set）识别问题：分类器被训练时只见过闭集标签，却要在部署时面对闭集之外的样本。单细胞里这种情况极其常见——新疾病状态、新发育阶段、罕见免疫亚群、甚至肿瘤的恶性细胞，都可能是参考里不存在的。</p>\n<p>识别未知细胞的工程手段有三类，实践中通常叠加使用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>置信度门槛</strong>：用上文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_q(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的 top-1 占比，或用分类器（如 CellTypist 的逻辑回归）输出的最大后验概率。低于阈值即判为 unknown。简单但会随细胞类型粒度变化而漂移。</li>\n<li><strong>嵌入距离检验</strong>：计算查询细胞到参考<strong>最近邻的距离分布</strong>，与参考细胞互相之间的最近邻距离分布比较。查询细胞若落在参考距离分布的远端尾部，即为离群。这是分布无关、对粒度不敏感的做法。</li>\n<li><strong>显式 novelty 检测</strong>：scArches 生态中的 scANVI 支持把「未知」作为一个显式类别参与半监督训练；也有方法用查询样本自身的无监督聚类结果与转移标签做一致性检验——若一个查询簇内部转移标签高度混杂，说明它可能是参考未覆盖的新状态。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>推荐的工程流水线是：先按置信度初筛，再用距离分布复核，最后对残余不确定细胞做查询内聚类并人工审阅。关键纪律是<strong>未知判定必须落成可追溯的记录</strong>（哪些细胞、什么理由、由谁审阅），因为图谱缺口恰恰是最有价值的发现——它指示下一次参考更新的方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地清单与常见陷阱\">工程落地清单与常见陷阱</h2><p>把参考图谱投入生产前，下面几条是反复踩过的坑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基因空间对齐是最大的隐形错误源。</strong> 参考用 2000 HVG、查询用自己算的 2000 HVG，两者基因集不同会静默产生错误投影。必须让查询侧使用<strong>参考侧导出的基因列表</strong>，缺基因补零而不是重新选 HVG。</li>\n<li><strong>参考标签的粒度必须与下游用途匹配。</strong> 若下游只要「上皮/免疫/基质」三分，就不要用 40 类精细参考，否则转移标签的噪声会淹没信号。</li>\n<li><strong>细胞类型比例是受批次影响最大的量。</strong> 转移标签可以用来比较比例，但必须先确认查询与参考的整合没有系统性压缩某类细胞；比例结论要有独立方法交叉验证。</li>\n<li><strong>固定随机种子并记录版本。</strong> 参考嵌入、基因列表、阈值、软件版本都应写入制品元数据，否则半年后无法解释为何同一份数据得到不同的标签。</li>\n<li><strong>把「投影失败」当一等公民处理。</strong> 一个样本若 30% 以上细胞落入未知，整个样本的转移结论都应降级为「待审阅」，而不是按未发生处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考图谱工程的成熟度标志，不是转移标签的准确率数字，而是<strong>团队是否拥有一个可版本化、可增量更新、缺口可追溯的图谱制品</strong>。当新样本到来时，流水线能自动产出「标签 + 置信度 + 未知标记 + 缺口报告」四件套，人工只需处理未知部分——这才是把一次性注释成本转化为长期资产的方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>参考图谱把「每次重新注释」变成「一次构建、多次投影」，核心收益是统一坐标系与分钟级增量标注。</li>\n<li>标签转移是投影 + kNN 加权投票，投票集中度天然充当置信度。</li>\n<li>参考质量分三层把关：标签层级一致性、留一供体稳健性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 阈值）、投影后分布漂移监测。</li>\n<li>scArches 走 VAE adapter 微调（跨平台强、需 GPU、需固定 seed）；Symphony 走闭式 Harmony 投影（快、确定性、跨平台弱）。</li>\n<li>未知细胞是开放集问题，需置信度门槛 + 距离分布检验 + 显式 novelty 检测叠加。</li>\n<li>基因空间对齐、标签粒度、比例可比性、版本记录、投影失败处理，是生产环境最常见的五类陷阱。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本 hub 的<a href=\"trajectory-rna-velocity-model\">轨迹推断与 RNA 速率动力学模型</a>讨论如何在同一嵌入上推断发育方向；<a href=\"multi-sample-integration-methods\">多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制</a>给出参考侧整合的指标与算法细节。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"参考图谱构建与标签转移工程实践","id":"参考图谱构建与标签转移工程实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把「每次重新注释」变成「一次构建、多次投影」","id":"核心概念-把-每次重新注释-变成-一次构建-多次投影"},{"level":2,"text":"参考图谱的三层质量控制","id":"参考图谱的三层质量控制"},{"level":2,"text":"scArches 与 Symphony 的工程取舍","id":"scarches-与-symphony-的工程取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"未知细胞类型与开放集问题","id":"未知细胞类型与开放集问题"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地清单与常见陷阱","id":"工程落地清单与常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/trajectory-integration-atlas/multi-sample-integration-methods"},"next":{"title":"空间转录组平台与分辨率数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/spatial-transcriptomics-platform-analysis/spatial-platform-resolution-model"}}